	(text_box "Use boot contrl pins with caution: 0,2,5,12,15\n\nIO0: avoid device connections\nIO2: avoid external pullups - will cause bootloader fail.\nIO5: has builtin pullup at POR\nIO12: avoid external pullups - will cause boot fail.\nIO15: has builtin pull at POR\n\nADC2 is not available when using wifi"
